<title>USA: Toolex Alpha NV first half net rises.</title>
<headline>Toolex Alpha NV first half net rises.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK, N.Y. 1996-09-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr primary		 2.68			N/A</p>
<p> Net			 44,100		   35,300</p>
<p> Revs		     326,400		  275,600</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Results in Swedish crowns and listed under Swedish Generally Accepted Accounting Principles (GAAP).</p>
<p>On a pro forma basis, first-half earnings were US$8.53 million, or US$0.44 per share, vs US$6.07 million, or US$0.32.</p>
<p>Toolex completed its initial public offering in May.</p>
<p>--New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610</p>
